{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "70b83837-48fa-53ad-8b68-504bceff2848"/*LoadVdb*/,
  "Description": "Loads grids from an OpenVDB file, or one frame of a numbered sequence such as an EmberGen or Houdini cache.\n\nReads uncompressed, zip and blosc-compressed data as written by Houdini, Blender or TiXL. Float grids become the primary data of the volume; vector grids such as velocity or color ride along in the same set. The file is reloaded when it changes and the operator is evaluated. Parsing runs on a background thread, so a large file does not stall the renderer; the output appears once the read has finished.\n\nAKA: import vdb, read openvdb, vdb sequence, embergen\n\nTips\n- Leave GridName empty to load every supported grid.\n- While a file is being read the previous value is kept; the output turns null only if the file is missing or invalid.\n- To play a sequence, put #### or %d where the frame number goes in Path and drive Frame from time; frames that load slower than the playback are skipped, not queued.\n- Scale, ZUp and Translation place a file in the scene when it is read, so every operator downstream works in scene units.",
  "InputUis": [
    {
      "InputId": "1e3dcc23-489a-5a54-b1af-c04d85ac3b8a"/*GridName*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": -30.0
      },
      "Description": "Load only the grid with this name. Empty loads all supported grids.",
      "Usage": "Default"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "6b2d3103-e07f-4364-ae0f-572e22ff767a"/*Translation*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 120.0
      },
      "Description": "Moves the grids after scaling and turning them."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "a53afcdd-64d2-474b-8a3d-e437f9681de4"/*Scale*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 60.0
      },
      "GroupTitle": "Placement",
      "Description": "Scales the grids on load, for files in centimetres or in voxel units. Level-set distances scale along.",
      "Min": 0.001,
      "Max": 10.0,
      "Scale": 0.001,
      "ClampMin": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "c5a3b6f4-6e0d-4b8a-9a63-2f1d7e4c9b05"/*Frame*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 30.0
      },
      "Description": "Frame of a sequence: replaces the #### or %d in Path. Ignored for a single file.",
      "Min": 0,
      "Max": 250
    },
    {
      "InputId": "e16c0dad-a228-5a6f-964b-82986746836e"/*Path*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      },
      "Description": "File path of the .vdb file. For a sequence, mark the frame number with #### or %d, as in fire_####.vdb or fire_%d.vdb.",
      "Usage": "FilePath"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "f32c0f35-8925-491c-ad36-757c30c37142"/*ZUp*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 90.0
      },
      "Description": "The file is Z-up, as caches from Blender and EmberGen are: stand it upright in TiXL's Y-up space."
    }
  ],
  "SymbolChildUis": [],
  "OutputUis": [
    {
      "OutputId": "f25cded9-8ca1-5431-9399-8d1285e00703"/*Volume*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      }
    }
  ]
}